{"availability":"available","full":"jiayuxuan123/TurboDL","name":"TurboDL","description":"高性能多线程下载引擎 SDK（纯 Kotlin/JVM，无 Android 依赖）：分段并发、动态分段、断点续传、限速、代理、DNS，其他协议走插件（自带 HLS 与 JavaScript 插件加载器）。仅参考 aria2/IDM/axel/Persepolis/Motrix/ab-download-manager 的思想。","category":"Productivity","language":"Kotlin","stars":5,"forks":1,"created":"2026-08-25T05:24:23Z","updated":"2026-10-10T14:45:49Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://jiayuxuan123.github.io/TurboDL/","topics":["apache2","aria2","download-manager","downloader","http","idm","jvm","kotlin","multithreading","sdk"],"demo":"https://jiayuxuan123.github.io/TurboDL/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:11.064Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:11.064Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:11.064Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T15:06:11.064Z","stars":5,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["High-performance multi-threaded download engine SDK — pure Kotlin/JVM, no Android dependency, embeddable in any JVM application (including Android).","Website: jiayuxuan123.github.io/TurboDL — documentation, plugin authoring guide, download page","Languages: English · 简体中文 · 繁體中文 · 日本語 · 한국어 · Deutsch"],"features":["Multi-threaded segmented download: HTTP Range parallel segments, connection reuse (HTTP/2 multiplexing + keep-alive).","Dynamic segmentation: fine-grained pre-splitting + work stealing, so slow connections don't drag down the whole transfer and the \"last segment finishing on a single thread\" long tail is eliminated (IDM/XDM idea).","Sequential segment priority: earlier segments are downloaded first, enabling progressive preview/playback (axel/Persepolis idea).","Robust fallback & retry:","Server does not support / ignores Range → automatic fallback to whole-file single-stream download;"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jiayuxuan123/TurboDL/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a505cbac24a3c4a4339ce0296c3906efdced78c4a0cab2256e35a3b03ac2